B.Pv=new A.dh("You must be at least 18 years old to use Swifflyy. By creating an account you confirm that you are 18 or older and that the information you provide is accurate.","1. Who can use Swifflyy")
B.PI=new A.dh('Swifflyy lets you "drop" your current location so nearby people can discover you for one hour, within 1 km of your pin. Free accounts can drop up to 3 times per day. Swifflyy Plus (a \u20b929 daily pass or a \u20b949 weekly plan) removes the daily cap, extends your discovery reach up to 2 km, and shows your card first to people at your spot. Each drop is always pinned to your real, current location \u2014 it cannot be moved manually.',"2. How Swifflyy works")
B.PE=new A.dh("Swifflyy Plus comes in two one-time, non-renewing purchases \u2014 a Daily Pass (\u20b929, 24 hours) and a Weekly Plan (\u20b949, 7 days) \u2014 both granting unlimited drops, up to 2 km of discovery reach, and priority placement in nearby decks from the time of purchase. Buying again extends your remaining time; nothing auto-renews. Purchases are processed by the app store and are subject to the store's refund policy.","3. Swifflyy Plus")
B.Pp=new A.dh("Swifflyy has zero tolerance for objectionable content and abusive behaviour. You agree not to harass, threaten, impersonate, spam, scam, or share unlawful, hateful or sexually explicit content, and to follow our Content Policy in full. Accounts that break these rules are suspended or removed, and we cooperate with law enforcement where the law requires it.","4. Your conduct")
B.Q8=new A.dh("You own the photos and text you add to Swifflyy. You give us permission to store them and show them to other users as the app works \u2014 for example your first name, photos and profile details while a drop is active. Use only photos of yourself that you have the right to share. We may remove content that breaks these terms or the Content Policy.","5. Your content")
B.PO=new A.dh('You can report or block anyone from their profile or chat with "Report, block & unmatch". Blocking removes the match and stops that person reaching you or appearing in your deck again. Reports are reviewed by our team, normally within 24 hours, and we keep a record so repeat behaviour can be acted on.',"6. Reporting & blocking")
B.PQ=new A.dh("You are responsible for the photos and information you share and for your interactions with other users. We do not run background checks. Never share financial information with other users, meet in public places, and tell a friend where you are going.","7. Safety")
B.PX=new A.dh("You can delete your account at any time from Settings \u2192 Delete account; deletion is immediate and permanent. We may suspend or remove accounts that violate these terms, the Content Policy or the law. Unused Swifflyy Plus time is not refunded when an account is removed for a violation.","8. Ending your account")
B.Pw=new A.dh('Swifflyy is provided "as is". We are not responsible for the conduct of any user, online or offline. To the fullest extent permitted by law, our liability is limited to the amount you paid us in the prior 12 months. These terms are governed by the laws of India.',"9. Liability")
B.PD=new A.dh("We may update these terms; continued use after an update means you accept the revised terms. Questions: support@swifflyy.com. The full text is at swifflyy.com/terms.html. Swifflyy is operated by Swifflyy Technologies Private Limited, Gonda, Uttar Pradesh, India. Effective 8 September 2026.","10. Changes & contact")
